From 8a008c72e62e303f3f1029e73c8ee3090bd65c87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Gonzalez Martin <sergiog@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:17:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [rust jpeg] Fix progressive raw output and IDCT parity

Carry a local port of the final raw-input, accurate-IDCT, progressive
block-smoothing and raw-publication fixes proposed in zune-image PR494:
https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image/pull/494

Upstream commits e7eaf26bc101df958f451a9affc4bd721d1154ba and
7d3e74c34b2252b6a4477399c7c52ccc9cf0fcab contain the corresponding fixes.
Preserve strict validation, resumable retries, row padding, and existing
packed/scanline best-effort decoding while matching native raw output.

Bug: 493315750
Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
