+                    + 13 * dc07 + 38 * dc08 + 13 * dc09 - dc10 + dc16
+                    - 13 * dc17 - 38 * dc18 - 13 * dc19 + dc20 + dc21
+                    + 3 * dc22 + 3 * dc23 + 3 * dc24 + dc25,
